Package: catlasr
Title: R Infrastructure for CATLAS Experimental Learning Research
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Josef", "Mana", , "josef.mana@protonmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides datasets, modeling interfaces, and research utilities for
    the *Conditioning as a Theory of Learning, Attention, Semantics, and more*
    (CATLAS) project. Includes summaries of associative learning experiments and
    effect sizes, tools for constructing and rendering experimental stimuli,
    tools for preprocessing of experimental data, interfaces for computational
    learning models (TBA) and utilities for producing reproducible analyses and
    publication-ready outputs.
